  "description": "Whether you're going for a quick ride or exploring the unknown – the Divide adapts perfectly to your adventures. As the first model in our E-X.Over series, it offers maximum customizability, allowing you to tailor it exactly to your needs. The EU-made aluminum frame integrates the powerful Pinion Motor.Gearbox.Unit with an impressive 600% gear range and the maintenance-free Gates Carbon Drive™ system. With 29-inch wheels featuring all-terrain tires and a 120mm suspension fork, you’ll conquer even the toughest trails with ease. And the best part? With almost unlimited color options, you can design your Divide to match your style perfectly – for a bike as unique as your adventures!",
